@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.26.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.26.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.26.0 (2026-11-24): Chapter 10 release story done. Deck 4.1.0 and page 9.21.0 pass every automatic check and carry a recorded verdict from each of three roles on four conditions (agent-made, not independent). With chapter 11, 24 of 24 verdicts are recorded."""@en .

ex:TK11_Release_10_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Review record 08-tooling/ch10-deck/logs_v4_1_0/REVIEW_RECORD_ch10_v1_0_0.md: 12 verdicts (four conditions times three roles), 10 met and 2 partly met (slides 34 and 37 are dense at small type). Labelled agent-made and not independent. The review changed the material before the verdicts: the shelve example made runnable in the browser, the Mad Libs result made equal on slide and page, notes and practice answers written again for the one-box code." .
ex:TK11_Release_10_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-run from the files on deck 4.1.0, manifest 1.3.0, source 1.1.0, page 9.21.0. Logs: 08-tooling/ch10-deck/logs_v4_1_0 (code check C1 C2 C4 C5, deck standard 1.2.0 13 of 13, overlap, reader notes, story prose, fit, layout, notes all clean) and 08-tooling/ch10-page/logs_v9_21_0 (code check C1 to C5 0 findings including the page; page test 9.39.0 exit 0, 412 features passed, 0 failed, with all 18 chapter-code examples opened and run in the browser)." .
ex:TK11_Deck_10_Verify backlog:hasAuditNote "Correction 2026-11-24: the checks of 1.22.0 were run on deck 4.0.0, which the page story superseded by deck 4.1.0 (source 1.1.0; see 1.26.0 for the logs on 4.1.0)." .
ex:ST11_Release_10 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Criterion met: logs saved and a verdict from each role on each reviewed condition. Chapter 10 is released as deck 4.1.0 and page 9.21.0; deck 4.0.0 and page 9.20.0 stay as superseded files." .
ex:Obs2_Obj11_ReviewVerdicts a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj11_ReviewVerdicts ; backlog:observedValue 24 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-24T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Chapters 10 and 11: 24 of 24 verdicts recorded."@en .
